1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:05,430
On behalf of LP Clubs, I'd like to welcome you all here today.

2
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:10,410
My name's Sandy Fisher and I'm one of the fitness managers here.

3
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:15,826
Before we start our tour of the club I'll just run through some basic

4
00:00:15,826 --> 00:00:20,461
information about the facilities we have here, including recent improvements,

5
00:00:20,461 --> 00:00:23,550
and explain the types of membership available.

6
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:31,670
Our greatest asset is probably our swimming pool which at 25 metres isn't Olympic-sized.

7
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:36,290
But now we've expanded it to eight lanes, it's much wider.

8
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,932
This means there are rarely more than a couple of people at a time

9
00:00:39,932 --> 00:00:41,360
in each lane.

10
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:47,339
Unfortunately, there isn't space for an outdoor pool here but the glass roof on

11
00:00:47,339 --> 00:00:49,485
the swimming pool is partly retractable,

12
00:00:49,485 --> 00:00:54,140
which means you can enjoy something of the open-air experience on warmer days.

13
00:00:54,140 --> 00:01:02,280
Our recently refurbished fitness suite has all the latest exercise equipment including ten new

14
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,122
running machines,

15
00:01:03,122 --> 00:01:06,410
and a wide range of weight-training machines.

16
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:11,826
Each member is given full training in how to operate the equipment

17
00:01:11,826 --> 00:01:16,440
and there is always a trainer on duty to offer help and advice.

18
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:22,888
Although we do have adult-only times after 6 and at certain times at weekends,

19
00:01:22,888 --> 00:01:25,740
children are well catered for.

20
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:30,016
Older children continue to benefit from a wide range of tuition;

21
00:01:30,016 --> 00:01:33,710
anything from trampolining to yoga.

22
00:01:33,710 --> 00:01:40,257
One thing all our members appreciate about us is that we take very good

23
00:01:40,257 --> 00:01:40,920
care of them.

24
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:44,850
This starts on day one with your personal assessment.

25
00:01:44,850 --> 00:01:50,100
You are asked to fill in a questionnaire giving details of any health problems.

26
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:54,030
One of our personal trainers will then go through this with you.

27
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:59,053
The trainer will then take you through the safety rules for using the equipment

28
00:01:59,053 --> 00:02:00,700
in the fitness suite.

29
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:06,323
During your next exercise session a personal trainer will work with you to make

30
00:02:06,323 --> 00:02:08,110
sure you understand these.

31
00:02:08,110 --> 00:02:12,993
It's very important to do this because we really do want to avoid having

32
00:02:12,993 --> 00:02:14,380
any sports injuries.

33
00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:19,560
There's a lot more to looking after yourself than simply lifting weights!

34
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:26,361
At the end of the personal assessment,the trainer will draw up a plan, outlining

35
00:02:26,361 --> 00:02:29,410
what you should try to achieve within a six-week period.

36
00:02:29,410 --> 00:02:33,290
This will then be reviewed at the end of the six weeks.

37
00:02:33,290 --> 00:02:39,630
Now, I'll just quickly run through the types of membership we have available.

38
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:45,501
All members must pay a joining fee of 90 in addition to the rates

39
00:02:45,501 --> 00:02:47,290
for the monthly membership fees.

40
00:02:47,290 --> 00:02:53,070
Gold membership entitles you to free entry at all LP Clubs.

41
00:02:53,070 --> 00:02:56,889
There are now LP clubs in all major cities and towns

42
00:02:56,889 --> 00:03:00,990
so if you travel a lot this will be a great advantage.

43
00:03:00,990 --> 00:03:07,757
Individual gold membership costs 50 a month and joint membership for you

44
00:03:07,757 --> 00:03:10,950
and your partner will cost 75.

45
00:03:10,950 --> 00:03:17,509
Premier membership is for professional people whose work commitments make it difficult for them

46
00:03:17,509 --> 00:03:22,363
to use the club during the day and so LP gives booking preferences to

47
00:03:22,363 --> 00:03:24,730
Premier members at peak times.

48
00:03:24,730 --> 00:03:28,533
This means you will find it easier to book the sessions at times that

49
00:03:28,533 --> 00:03:29,760
suit you.

50
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:35,030
Reciprocal arrangements with other LP Clubs are available to Premier members.

51
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:38,042
Premier membership is for individuals only,

52
00:03:38,042 --> 00:03:41,295
but you will be sent passes for guests every month.

53
00:03:41,295 --> 00:03:44,990
The monthly fee is 65.

54
00:03:44,990 --> 00:03:50,151
You don't have to have any special clothes or equipment when you visit the

55
00:03:50,151 --> 00:03:50,520
club.

56
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:54,133
We provide robes and hairdryers in the changing rooms,

57
00:03:54,133 --> 00:03:59,753
but it's very important to remember your photo card because you won't be able

58
00:03:59,753 --> 00:04:01,760
to get in without it.

59
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:04,320
For people who aren't working during the day then ...
